  "description": "Mid terrace two double bedroom house on 3 levels overlooking the River Suir and Waterford City.\n\nLocated just a 10 minute walk from clock tower (soon to be less than 5 mins on the completion of the new North Quays pedestrian/cycle bridge which is expected to complete next year).\n\nThe accommodation (900 sq/ft )has recently been redecorated and consists of two double bedrooms (with new mattresses), two bathrooms (one with electric shower,toilet and wash handbasin, second with electric shower and handbasin, tumble dryer), a lounge, kitchen (with new electric cooker,microwave,washer/dryer),stairwell with wooden rack storage for linens and a private enclosed yard with washing line.\n\nPrivate residents free parking is also provided directly adjacent to the terrace. \n\nHeating is provided by electricity on a Prepaypower 1 year contract.\n\nNO PETS & NO SMOKING \n\nLocal amenities include shops,garage,doctors surgery, dentist,school,library,health centre,take-away outlets, hairdressers.\n\nThe current North Quays development will also see the establishment of the new transportation hub just 5 mins walk which will include the new railway station, bus station and taxi hub.\n\nApplication is via E mail ONLY and MUST include a copy of all prospective tenants latest CV, current place(s) of work (or financial means) . \n\nTwo references ( work and another independent person) will also be required prior to contract approval along with proof of ID (Passport/Garda ID card/Driving licence and a valid PPS number which will be provided to the Rental Tenancy Board).\n\nDue to the volume of expected applicants ONLY  ACCEPTED viewing tenants will be responded to for an arranged viewing appointment.",
